| `populations` | 31 | 进化种群数 |
| `timeout_in_seconds` | None | 超时（秒） |
| `binary_operators` | ["+","-","*","/"] | 二元运算符 |
| `unary_operators` | None | 一元运算符 |
| `expression_spec` | ExpressionSpec() | 表达式类型（模板/标准） |
